OL,3,GNEWSAMajor report proposes welfare
OL,4,Achanges, apprenticeships and tax cuts
OL,5,Ato help 440,000 young people into work
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe proposes that under-25s should no
OL,8,Flonger be able to claim the health
OL,9,Felement of universal credit; businesses
OL,10,Fshould be taxed less for employing
OL,11,Fyoung people; and public and private
OL,12,Fsector employers should hire more
OL,13,Fapprentices
OL,15,FEarlier, he said his proposed changes
OL,16,Fare not about saving money - but he
OL,17,Fadded billions could be saved from the
OL,18,Fbenefits bill within 10 years
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
